  SENSITIVITY OF THE KILLING GATE (how far a bound would have to move for the region to open)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    the tachyon gate is c_14 >= 3 Omega_d/Omega_m = 2.5333 for rate <= H; tolerating rate <= N H gives c_14 >= 2.5333/N^2:
       N =    1 e-folds per Hubble time tolerated  ->  c_14 >= 2.533e+00   (PPN alpha_1 allows c_14 <= 2.50e-05: short by 1.0e+05x)
       N =    3 e-folds per Hubble time tolerated  ->  c_14 >= 2.815e-01   (PPN alpha_1 allows c_14 <= 2.50e-05: short by 1.1e+04x)
       N =   10 e-folds per Hubble time tolerated  ->  c_14 >= 2.533e-02   (PPN alpha_1 allows c_14 <= 2.50e-05: short by 1.0e+03x)
       N =   30 e-folds per Hubble time tolerated  ->  c_14 >= 2.815e-03   (PPN alpha_1 allows c_14 <= 2.50e-05: short by 1.1e+02x)
       N =  100 e-folds per Hubble time tolerated  ->  c_14 >= 2.533e-04   (PPN alpha_1 allows c_14 <= 2.50e-05: short by 1.0e+01x)
       N =  300 e-folds per Hubble time tolerated  ->  c_14 >= 2.815e-05   (PPN alpha_1 allows c_14 <= 2.50e-05: short by 1.1e+00x)
    the rate is independent of |K_2| and Q_0 only because eps_0 is fixed by the condensate carrying Omega_d;
    at a smaller dark fraction Omega_d the threshold falls as 3 Omega_d/Omega_m:
       Omega_d =  0.266  ->  c_14 >= 2.533e+00   (1.0e+05x the PPN ceiling)
       Omega_d =  0.100  ->  c_14 >= 9.524e-01   (3.8e+04x the PPN ceiling)
       Omega_d =  0.010  ->  c_14 >= 9.524e-02   (3.8e+03x the PPN ceiling)
       Omega_d =  0.001  ->  c_14 >= 9.524e-03   (3.8e+02x the PPN ceiling)

    THE ONE ESCAPE, computed: free the condensate's dust amplitude (g03e: a free initial datum).
    rate <= H at every a  <=>  Omega_d,eff = |K_2| Q_0^2 eps_0/(3 H_0^2) <= Omega_m c_14/3.
    at the largest PPN-allowed c_14 = 2.50e-05 this is Omega_d,eff <= 2.625e-06,
    i.e. 1.01e+05 times SMALLER than the dark component the dark-sector window G4 and the cluster
    atmosphere (g03u: M_d/M_b ~ 6.8 at 100 kpc) require the condensate to be.  The escape exists and it
    empties G4 of content: a tachyon-free clock and a condensate dark sector cannot both be had.
  [PASS] T4 [the escape is not free] freeing eps_0 removes the tachyon only by shrinking the condensate's dust fraction below what the dark-sector gate G4 needs; check that the two are numerically incompatible at the PPN-allowed c_14   (Omega_d,eff <= 2.625e-06 against Omega_d = 0.266 needed: short by 1.01e+05x)

  caveats, stated: (i) the 'fraction of the grid' is a measure over the stated logarithmic grid and has no
  prior meaning -- only the emptiness/non-emptiness statements are grid-independent, and those were also
  checked analytically where noted; (ii) the tachyon gate uses the ANALYTIC term g03w identifies in the clock
  equation (re-derived here from g03t's printed coefficients), not g03w's numerical eigenmode, whose separation
  from a constraint-differentiation artefact g03w itself records as open; (iii) G3 extends g03t's D7 floor by
  the D5 screening factor, which is an interpolation between D7 (S_eff = 1) and g03v's fast-branch V4 (S_eff <= 0);
  (iv) G4's window edges come from g03r's coarse |K_2| grid, re-expressed on H so that the alt footing is
  consistent; (v) gamma_v's xi-dependence is extrapolated from g03y's exponential-carrier pairs and is an
  OUTPUT, never a cut; (vi) the grid is positive in every parameter, as THE_ACTION section 2 fixes the signs.

